OL,3,AWhy tiny cars are taking off across
OL,4,AEurope
OL,5,
OL,6,FSelena Buse, 16, reverses her Citroen
OL,7,FAmi out of a parking space and heads
OL,8,Foff past the school playground. Heads
OL,9,Fturn. The Ami looks pretty remarkable.
OL,10,FFuturist or like-a-toaster depending on
OL,11,Fyour point of view. But it's changed
OL,12,Fher life.
OL,14,F"I got it because I really needed it to
OL,15,Fget to school. And I use it to visit
OL,16,Ffriends on the weekends. It's
OL,17,Findispensable in rural areas like where
OL,18,FI live," she says.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
