OL,3,AVeteran Nigerian Nollywood actor Pete
OL,4,AEdochie dies aged 79
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran Nigerian actor Pete Edochie,
OL,7,Fone of Africa's most celebrated film
OL,8,Fstars, has died at the age of 79, his
OL,9,Ffamily has announced.
OL,11,FKnown for his deep voice, commanding
OL,12,Fscreen presence and memorable use of
OL,13,FAfrican proverbs, Edochie became a
OL,14,Fhousehold name across Africa, often
OL,15,Fportraying powerful traditional rulers,
OL,16,Fwealthy businessmen and family
OL,17,Fpatriarchs.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
