OL,3,ASubstance released at concert could be
OL,4,Alinked to robberies, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "unknown substance" that prompted a
OL,7,Fmass evacuation at a rap concert may be
OL,8,Flinked to robberies and stolen
OL,9,Fjewellery at the venue, police have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FMore than 12,000 people were evacuated
OL,13,Ffrom Manchester's Co-op Live during a
OL,14,Fperformance by US rapper Don Toliver on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FOne person was taken to hospital and 88
OL,18,Fothers were treated at the scene after
OL,19,Fconcertgoers reported a "horrible
OL,20,Fsmell" and some people "coughing up
OL,21,Fblood".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
